An abrupt shift towards a hotter and drier climate regime in the Western Eurasian Steppe
                        Jinling Piao 
            ORCID: orcid.org/0000-0001-8775-15761,2, Jong-Seong Kug 
            ORCID: orcid.org/0000-0003-2251-25792, Wen Chen 
            ORCID: orcid.org/0000-0001-9327-90793,4, Mi-Kyung Sung 
