Data availability

            The CRU TS4.09 data are available from https://crudata.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/hrg/. The PREC/L data are available from the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA) Physical Sciences Laboratory (https://psl.noaa.gov/data/gridded/data.precl.html). The TerraClimate data are available at https://climate.northwestknowledge.net/TERRACLIMATE/index_directDownloads.php. The GLEAM4.2 data are available at https://www.gleam.eu/. The ERA5 data are available at https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/#!/search?text=ERA5&type=dataset. The ESACCI data are available at https://catalogue.ceda.ac.uk/uuid/ff890589c21f4033803aa550f52c980c/. The daily CPC data are available at https://psl.noaa.gov/data/gridded/data.cpc.globaltemp.html. The NOAA GISTMEP data are available at https://psl.noaa.gov/data/gridded/. The NOAAGlobalTemp data are available at https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/land-based-station/noaa-global-temp. The MPI-GE data are available at https://rda.ucar.edu/datasets/d651014/dataaccess/#. The MIROC6 and CMIP6 model simulations are available at https://pcmdi.llnl.gov/CMIP6/. The MOD12C1 data are available at https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/catalog/lpcloud-mcd12c1-061. The GLASS data are available at https://glass.hku.hk/download.html. The NIRv data are available via figshare at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.12981977 (ref. 77). The FLUXCOM data are available at https://www.fluxcom.org/.
          Code availability

            The data were analysed using the NCAR Command Language (http://www.ncl.ucar.edu/). The codes associated with this study are available from the corresponding authors upon request.
